    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0828" n="708" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg708"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/4378: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schurman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-25T12:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received May 25—5:53
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>232. My 228, May 23, 11 a.m.<anchor n="45" xml:id="d458-f1"/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Albany</hi> reenforcement Legation Guard left
                    to-day.</p>
                <p>Chang Tso-lin with 30,000 men entrenching between Chinwangtao and Shanhaikwan and
                    declares will fight. Believe that Wu will soon compel them to follow their
                    comrades beyond wall. That done <hi rendition="#italic">Albany</hi> no longer
                    necessary on account civil war.</p>
                <p>Huston telegraphs as follows: “May 23, 10 a.m. Ten thousand Chen’s troops from
                    Kwangsi stationed outskirts Canton have declared themselves independent and
                    threaten city, demand reinstatement of Chen as Commander in Chief. Wei
                        Pang-ping<anchor n="45a" xml:id="d458-f2"/> wields real power in the
                    city.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schurman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d458-f1" n="45" xml:id="d458-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d458-f2" n="45a" xml:id="d458-f2-content">
                <p>Commander, Third Division, Kwangtung army.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
